<Base title="How it works" description="How pre-order drops work: reserve, we import, we deliver.">
  <h1>How a drop works</h1>
  <p class="lead">You reserve before we import, so the price is lower and nothing sits unsold.</p>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li><strong>Reserve.</strong> Pre-order during the early tier and pay a 30% deposit or the full amount.</li>
    <li><strong>We import.</strong> One consolidated shipment flies in. It clears customs and FSSAI checks.</li>
    <li><strong>We pack.</strong> Everything is checked and repacked in Bengaluru.</li>
    <li><strong>You receive it.</strong> We collect any balance and dispatch, usually three to four weeks after pre-orders close.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>Three price tiers</h2>
  <p>Early pre-order is the lowest. Pre-order after that is slightly higher. Once goods clear and we hold stock, the ready-stock price applies, if any is left.</p>
  <h2>If something goes wrong</h2>
  <p>We tell you at every stage on each drop’s page. If a drop is delayed past our stated window or cannot be delivered, you can take a full refund. Details are in the <a href="/policies/refunds/">refund policy</a>.</p>
</Base>
